---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';import ProjectCard from '../../components/ProjectCard.astro';import {applications} from '../../data/content';
---
<Base title="Applications & Innovation Lab" description="Explore medical and digital health projects by Dr Mahantesh Bhairumali, with transparent development status and source links."><PageHeader eyebrow="Applications / Innovation lab" title="From an idea to a useful tool." intro="A space for medical, research, and educational applications—with a clear view of what each project does and where it stands." /><section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Project notebook</h2><span class="small-label">Development status shown on every project</span></div>{applications.map(project => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}</section><section class="section wrap two-col"><h2>Built with curiosity.<br />Reviewed with care.</h2><div class="prose"><p>Availability of source code does not establish clinical validity. Project pages distinguish prototypes from verified releases and describe known limitations.</p><p>These listings are for professional exploration. They do not provide individual medical advice.</p></div></section></Base>
